  "changes": [
    "Internal ADC1 channels use a fixed 12-bit register driver; diagnostics keep the discard plus median5 for each of three channels, while entropy keeps raw VBAT samples.",
    "SPI1 PA5/PA6/PA7 mode0 master uses owned polling and DMA2 stream2/3 channel3; NOR settings, SFDP, write verification, power gates and shared bus arbiter remain. UC1609 keeps synchronous polling.",
    "HD44780 A00/A02 initialization uses the existing owned four-bit bus, with cold/warm nibble synchronization. WS0010 controller sequence and text rendering remain.",
    "F401/F411 RTC calendar, alarm A/B, wakeup timer, backup registers, calibration and LSE/LSI source switching use owned registers. ES0287 synchronization and alarm interrupt workarounds are covered by the hardware-state model.",
    "Release contract, dependency installer and F401 CMake remove the external LiquidCrystal/STM32RTC requirements. Final ELF gates prevent the removed adapters and HAL ADC/SPI/DMA/RTC symbols from returning."
  ],
