  "test_harness_corrections": [
    "The DFU preflight accepts the actual whitespace in the Internal Flash descriptor but still requires the pinned serial, all four alternates and healthy USB descriptors before any write.",
    "RTC replies are correlated with command echoes, including a prompt-prefixed echo, so queued identity replies cannot be mistaken for alarm status. Mutating commands are sent once.",
    "A one-second alarm can fire before USB reconnect on both baseline and candidate. The HIL accepts either real normal firing or missed-alarm restoration; a separate 2.2-second ROM hold verified a genuinely missed deadline on both baseline and final Classic."
  ],
